WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.063
Step 1.4 puts a group managed account on
a test host, and it isn't made by hand:

2
00:00:05.063 --> 00:00:07.904
it goes through Chapter 6's approved plan,

3
00:00:07.904 --> 00:00:11.413
and the pipeline applies
it with the reviewed hash.

4
00:00:11.413 --> 00:00:16.662
In the test forest only, before the pipeline
exists, a person may send it instead.

5
00:00:16.662 --> 00:00:20.201
On the host, Test A D Service
Account must print true.

6
00:00:20.201 --> 00:00:23.562
Step 1.5 creates the workload policies.

7
00:00:23.562 --> 00:00:28.166
Microsoft Learn says they cover only
single-tenant service principals,

8
00:00:28.166 --> 00:00:31.312
assigned directly, with
block as the only control.

9
00:00:31.312 --> 00:00:34.700
Chapter 8's script creates
every one report-only.
